  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS OPERATION WILL HELP THE INTEGRAL REFORM OF THE EDUCATIONAL SECTOR TO IMPROVE IT EFFICIENCY, CONSOLIDATE THE PROCESS OF THE EDUCATIONAL SERVICES AND PROVIDE BASIC EDUCATIONAL SERVICES AT PRIMARY IN RURAL AND URBAN AREAS. IT IS A HYBRID OPERATION WITH A FAST DISBURSEMENT COMPONENT.</narrative>
